            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyo kugaburira abera sinaruha mbibandikira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko nzi umutima wanyu ukunze ari wo mbirataho mu Banyamakedoniya, mbabwira yuko Abanyakaya bamaze umwaka biteguye, kandi ko guhirimbana kwanyu kwateye abenshi umwete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko natumye bene Data abo, kugira ngo uko kwirata twirata mwebwe kutazapfa ubusa, kandi no kugira ngo muzabe mwiteguye nk'uko nababwiye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko ntashaka ko twebwe (simvuze mwe) tuzakorwa n'isoni z'ibyo twiringiye, niba Abanyamakedoniya bamwe bazazana nanjye bagasanga mutiteguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumye nibwira yuko nkwiriye kwinginga bene Data abo kumbanziriza kujya iwanyu, ngo babanze gutunganya iby'ubuntu mwasezeranije kera, bibe byiteguwe nk'iby'ubuntu koko bitameze nk'iby'ubugūgu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ndavuga ibi ngo “Ubiba nke azasarura bike, naho ubiba nyinshi azasarura byinshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese atange nk'uko abigambiriye mu mutima we, atinuba kandi adahatwa kuko Imana ikunda utanga anezerewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi rero Imana ishobora kubasāzaho ubuntu bwose, kugira ngo murusheho gukora ibyiza byose, mufite ibibahagije muri byose ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
